2026-10-09 18:35:01        "excerpt": "dSPACE Company Overview, Contact Details & Competitors | LeadIQ\nOpportunity: Leverage dSPACE's collaboration with automotive manufacturers, suppliers, and aerospace/industrial automation sectors to cross-sell complementary simulation and validation tools, consulting, and training services in evolving markets such as electric vehicles, autonomy, and software-defined vehicles.\nOpportunity: Target growth by supporting dSPACE's US, UK, France, Japan, China, and Sweden regional teams with localized go-to-market resources, partner enablement, and region-specific case studies to accelerate wins in rising demand for high-fidelity vehicle simulation and power electronics validation.\nOpportunity: Align product development with dSPACE's AI integration efforts and the launch of advanced software like XSG Power Electronics Systems to offer joint solutions, accelerators, and custom validation workflows that address highly dynamic switching and AI-driven workflows.\nOpportunity: Prioritize engagement with Stellantis and other major OEMs/tiers already connected with dSPACE to expand collaboration through expanded software licenses, hardware-in-the-loop (HIL) testing, and scalable training programs for autonomous driving and electrification programs.\nOpportunity: Position as a trusted provider across automotive, aerospace, agriculture, and industrial automation by offering flexible deployment models, cloud and on-premise validation platforms, and comprehensive support packages that accelerate time-to-market for new vehicle platforms.",
