2026-10-09 21:33:18        "excerpt": "new SW-driven functions for Software Defined Vehicles (SDV) with Over-the-air updates are becoming a key differentiator, automotive OEMs and tier-1 suppliers are intensifying their cooperation resulting in rethinking their current ALM and PLM toolchain.\nCompetition will rely on market timing and the ability to innovate and deliver products faster that meet customer expectations by offering new technologies and at the same time being compliant with legal regulations. Here are some key challenges PTC is helping the automotive industry to overcome:\n- Support for achieving compliance with automotive standards/regulations\n<p>The automotive mega trends are enabled by the advancement of technology in electronics and SW with a substantial impact on the underlying product development toolchain.</p>\n<p>As complexity and cost are increasing and <a href=\"/en/industries/automotive/speed-to-market\">time to implement</a>&nbsp;new SW-driven functions for Software Defined Vehicles (SDV) with Over-the-air updates are becoming a key differentiator, automotive OEMs and tier-1 suppliers are intensifying their cooperation resulting in rethinking their current ALM and PLM toolchain.</p>\n<p>Competition will rely on market timing and the ability to innovate and deliver products faster that meet customer expectations by offering new technologies and at the same time being compliant with legal regulations. Here are some key challenges PTC is helping the automotive industry to overcome:</p>",
